Optional daily limit on new contacts for chosen campaigns, set in Configuration
> Campaign Settings > Daily Limit for New Contacts ("Limited campaigns" and
"New contacts per campaign per day", parameters campaign_daily_entry_campaigns
and campaign_daily_entry_limit). Campaigns in the campaign category with alias
"daily-limit" are limited too. mautic:campaigns:update adds at most that many
contacts from a limited campaign's segments in any 24 hours; the rest stay in
the segment and join on later runs. Contacts already in the campaign carry on
as scheduled, and contacts added to a campaign directly are not limited. A
limit of 0 keeps the stock behaviour.

